OL,5,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FEx-demolition man Phil Routledge
OL,7,     Fhopes to blow his guests away at
OL,8,     Fthe ultra-modern The Arches on the
OL,9,     FIsle of Man. But some of his
OL,10,     Fhigh-tech gadgets leave them
OL,11,     Fconfused.
OL,12,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FCan Robbie and John's traditional
OL,14,     FBlackpool B&B, The Trafford,
OL,15,     Fimpress their well-heeled rivals?
OL,16,     FThe hosts try to sweeten the deal
OL,17,     Fwith a lesson in how to make
OL,18,     FBlackpool rock.
