OL,5,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FEmpty-nester Julie Brogan welcomes
OL,7,     Fher rivals to the grand Sheepy
OL,8,     FLodge in Warwickshire, where she
OL,9,     Ffaces her worst fear: cooking
OL,10,     Fpoached eggs for her guests.
OL,11,G2030 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,13,     Fcompetition, and the rival B&Bers
OL,14,     Fmeet to settle some scores and to
OL,15,     Ffind out how much they've been
OL,16,     Fpaid - and who's won the week.
