OL,5,G2300 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FBuilder Frank, who's 63, has
OL,7,     Ffallen from height. While his
OL,8,     Fdaughter tells of her dad's many
OL,9,     Fsacrifices, a teenager who's been
OL,10,     Fhit by a car arrives with possible
OL,11,     Fbrain injuries.
OL,12,G0000 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FJohn, who's 77, has a suspected
OL,14,     Faneurysm. Carpenter Noel, who's
OL,15,     F62, has partially amputated his
OL,16,     Fthumb at work. Jamie's motorbike
OL,17,     Fhas collided with a car on a
OL,18,     Fmotorway slip road.
